  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Deep in a Western Desert sand tunnel near a tributary of the River of Time, Feng Jiu Ge activates the immortal killer move Silence Surpasses Sound when a shadow pounces from a ripple of time. Besides his seven songs, which include Separation Song, he keeps other sound path methods; this move is one of them, and long practice lets him cast it instantly. Under the silence a desolate monkey year beast’s growls vanish as it opens its mouth, and his drum fist and bell palm from Spirit Affinity House’s Three Sounds true inheritance make no sound either. In that silent fight he quickly gains the upper hand and slaughters the beast, then the same move erases its dying screams.",
